{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator\/next()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator\/next()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L344","fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV4nextSay6VertexQzGSgyF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"next"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"next()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"next"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"IteratorProtocol.next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MaximalCliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Iterator":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Iterator"}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Iterator"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"MaximalCliques.Iterator","role":"symbol"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"te